pe of a star destroyer chasing  the fleeing tantavi iv blockade runner  within minutes we meet princess leia  darth vader r2d2 c3po and even the  ever-present stormtroopers but really  it's that scrappy rebel blockade runner  fleeing laser bolts as the endless  leviathan of a star destroyer slowly  fills the screen as it pursues that  truly sets the tone for the entire film  even if audiences hadn't read the  opening crawl establishing the broad  strokes of the rebellion's battle  against the empire it would be able to  know whose side were meant to be on from  the visuals alone the star wars  mythology has grown for decades across  movies books toys comics and games but  it has never outgrown the iconography of  those first indelible minutes from 1977.  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  star wars are coming soon subscribe to  our youtube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you

